          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Scoundrel"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "When Falrok successfully Feints, the target is flat-footed against melee attacks he attempts against it until the end of his next turn. On a critical success, the target is flat-footed against all melee attacks until the end of their next turn, not just Falrok's."
